    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. You mentioned \"unresolved tensions\" and \"flashpoints.\" In your experience analyzing these kinds of emerging markets, is there a specific pattern to how these ethnic divisions typically manifest? Like, does the diversity itself make the political culture inherently more volatile compared to more homogeneous regions?",
